      {
       "@type": "Review",
       "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "reviewBody": "I've made this recipe several times now and it stores for quite some time, even using the fresh herbs. I've used it a month after and the flavours hold up and the herbs stay fresh in the butter. I double the recipe so I always have it on hand and don't have to make it so often. It is used on fish, pork and steak mainly and it's great everytime. I love garlic and it settles well into the butter when stored, so it's not as strong. Recommended.",
       "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Charmaine"
       },
       "datePublished": "2026-05-29"
      },
      {
       "@type": "Review",
